<title>MEXICO: Ahmsa to propose share buyback fund.</title>
<headline>Ahmsa to propose share buyback fund.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Board members of the steelmaker Altos Hornos de Mexico (AHMSA) will propose to shareholders that the company set up a fund to buy back shares, Ahmsa said in a statement.</p>
<p>Ahmsa said the proposal will be made at the annual meeting March 31 at its headquarters in Monclova, Coahuila.</p>
<p>((--Monterrey bureau +528 3457617))</p>
